      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it feels a little stiff for a luxury brand. can u make it sound a bit more \"human\" and less like a template? maybe something that explains that the delay was due to some unexpected chaos at the facility so it doesn't just sound like we're incompetent, but like something strange and out of our control happened.",
