    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\nSubject: A Message from [Brand Name] - Apologizing for the Delay in Your Order\n\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nWe're deeply sorry to hear that your order is still stuck in our sorting facility, and we want to start by saying how sorry we are for the distress and inconvenience this has caused. We're aware that our promised delivery date has long since passed, and we can only imagine the frustration you must be feeling as you wait for your package.\n\nTo provide some context, our fulfillment center in Memphis is experiencing an unusual backlog of orders, which is proving particularly challenging to navigate. We're working tirelessly with the facility to expedite the sorting and delivery of your order, but we acknowledge that this has pushed back our usual timeline.\n\nWe want to assure you that we're committed to making things right, and we'd like to offer a full refund for the shipping costs incurred. Please know that we value your business and your trust in our brand, and we're doing everything in our power to prevent this kind of delay from happening in the future.\n\nIf there's anything else we can do to make this right, please don't hesitate to reach out. We appreciate your understanding and look forward to delivering your order",
